{"at":"2026-11-11T11:53:16.672Z","account":"music-tools-x","platform":"x","status":"published","source":"manual","slotId":"music-tools-x:workflow:43015607515","text":"メロディ作りに「コード進行」より偶然がほしい人へ。Wave Theoryはウェーブテーブルの形を、キーに沿ったMIDIメロディに変えるプラグイン。音源ではないのでシンセの前段に挿して使う。アルペジエーターで満足なら急がなくてよさそう。","mediaUrl":null,"mediaType":"image","mediaAltText":null,"mediaQa":null,"mediaResolution":null,"commercial":{"kind":"organic","paidPartnership":false},"providerPostId":"2120485004857758093","ai":null,"features":null,"rationale":null,"predictedScore":null,"selectionMode":null,"experiment":null,"sources":[],"textHash":"ccc7ce6d7ad5eb442825"}
{"at":"2026-11-12T07:40:07.491Z","account":"music-tools-x","platform":"x","status":"published","source":"manual","slotId":"music-tools-x:workflow:43176919746","text":"録音ボタンを押す前の「今の音」を拾いたい人へ。 Bird'sのRolling Samplerは、通った音を循環録音し、欲しい部分だけドラッグで取り出せる。 音作り中の偶然を残す道具。DAWの遡及録音で足りているなら追加不要。","mediaUrl":"https://static1.squarespace.com/static/631c5e1bbb48726432037171/t/6711a3373606f60c9026afec/1729209143874/rs-themes.png","mediaType":"image","mediaAltText":null,"mediaQa":null,"mediaResolution":null,"commercial":{"kind":"organic","paidPartnership":false},"providerPostId":"2120783684504567984","ai":null,"features":null,"rationale":null,"predictedScore":null,"selectionMode":null,"experiment":null,"sources":[],"textHash":"b73a94f8b69151d38341"}
