{"at":"2026-11-13T11:18:52.544Z","account":"music-tools-x","platform":"x","status":"published","source":"manual","slotId":"music-tools-x:workflow:43416025364","text":"録ったボーカルや旋律を、音符単位で動かす無料ピッチエディタ「bubblegum」。音程だけでなく、音符の位置や長さも編集できます。手作業でフレーズを整えたい人向け。自動補正だけで足りるなら追加不要。","mediaUrl":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Mre7T837yqE/maxresdefault.jpg","mediaType":"image","mediaAltText":null,"mediaQa":null,"mediaResolution":null,"commercial":{"kind":"organic","paidPartnership":false},"providerPostId":"2121201122769510777","ai":null,"features":null,"rationale":null,"predictedScore":null,"selectionMode":null,"experiment":null,"sources":[],"textHash":"3f2a6805984d0da7f8a9"}
{"at":"2026-11-14T00:34:36.081Z","account":"music-tools-x","platform":"x","status":"published","source":"manual","slotId":"music-tools-x:workflow:43535087499","text":"音を「音程のある響き」に変えたい人へ。Polarity-RESは最大32個の共鳴点をスペクトラム上に置ける無料エフェクト。音符や倍音に合わせて配置でき、ノイズから音階感のある質感も作れます。普通のEQで十分なら追加は不要。","mediaUrl":"https://polarity.productions/polarity-res/assets/images/polarity-res-cover.jpg","mediaType":"image","mediaAltText":null,"mediaQa":null,"mediaResolution":null,"commercial":{"kind":"organic","paidPartnership":false},"providerPostId":"2121401373564514444","ai":null,"features":null,"rationale":null,"predictedScore":null,"selectionMode":null,"experiment":null,"sources":[],"textHash":"773ffbe13219b4f62812"}
{"at":"2026-11-14T11:17:34.888Z","account":"music-tools-x","platform":"x","status":"published","source":"manual","slotId":"music-tools-x:workflow:43589294647","text":"口琴のような倍音をシンセで探したい人へ。SuperDuper DSPのKubyzは、倍音や母音の響きを調整できる無料のオープンソース音源。一般的なシンセの音色で足りているなら、追加は不要。","mediaUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fortunto2/superduper-dsp/main/docs/screenshots/kubyz.png","mediaType":"image","mediaAltText":null,"mediaQa":null,"mediaResolution":null,"commercial":{"kind":"organic","paidPartnership":false},"providerPostId":"2121563184771314046","ai":null,"features":null,"rationale":null,"predictedScore":null,"selectionMode":null,"experiment":null,"sources":[],"textHash":"ec814cb181419cd64326"}
